<title>FRANCE: Axa-UAP targets 10 pct return on equity in 1997.</title>
<headline>Axa-UAP targets 10 pct return on equity in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer Axa/UAP targets a return on equity of some 10 percent at end 1997, board member Gerard de La Martiniere said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Over 1997 our target for return on invested capital is in the order of 10 percent. This is the target for 1996 that we are maintaining,&quot; he told an extraordinary meeting of Axa's shareholders.</p>
<p>He also said net dividend per share for 1996 would reach at least 7.50 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
